        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "ELECTRICAL CONTRACTORS"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Our electrical contractors are well trained and experienced in installing and maintaining electrical systems including wiring, breaker boxes, switches and other machinery."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "SUPPLY OF LIFT COMPONENTS"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We get the right product delivered to you at the right time when you need it the most saving your precious time and money."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "ELECTRICAL ASSISTANTS"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The skilled assistants for electricians to help in all their work. This makes the work of electricians way much easier to execute and complete it with zero errors."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "INSTALLATIONS OF NEW LIFTS"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In need of a new installation or be it a complete alteration of your existing building or a structural architecture we offer dynamic solutions that meets your requirements."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "ANNUAL MAINTENANCE CONTRACTS"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "An elevator requires time to time servicing so that the elevators runs smoothly. We provide the annual maintenance contracts for elevators that includes best in class servicing."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "PWD LICENCE WORK"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Upgradation and maintenance of roads that include national highways, major district roads, village roads and also construction of bridges, flyovers and ROB’s in the state."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "TECHNICAL CONSULTATIONS"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Expertise panel of professionals who are experienced in delivering exceptional service in technical supports, performing trouble shoot functions or any client’s issues."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "ACCREDITED ELECTRICIANS WITH WIREMAN’S LICENSES"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "All the workers and contractors working with us are highly trained professional and have the required wireman’s licence and permit to work in the industry."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "GENERAL WORKERS"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Skilled workers for the general duties like cleaning and preparing a job site, loading, unloading and delivering materials and are experienced in using a variety of tools."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "ALL KIND OF MAJOR AND MINOR REPAIRS"
