          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "ABOUT US"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Intal Elevators is involved with a variety of electrical works, ranging from Domestic to Industrial Installations and Electrical Contracting. In conjunction to our general electrical work, Intal Elevators has successfully completed larger contracts with and as elevators consultants. We pride ourselves on quality workmanship and service excellence. Intal Elevators is an authorized Elevator company and registered with all relevant authorities. Situated in the Thane, Maharashtra Region we have undertaken major projects throughout District."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "HISTORY"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Intal Elevators is formed by group of highly experienced vertical transportation professionals with individual experience of around 40 years in India and abroad. Products are designed with emphasis on comfort, safety and speed. We incorporate modern technology to keep pace with changing environmental and vertical transportation needs of the 21st century."
